sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    box rgb(239, 246, 255) Runtime router
      participant USER as User question
      participant API as FastAPI chat API
      participant ST1 as Stage1 request type
      participant ST2 as Stage2 agent route
      participant GATE as Runtime gate
    end

    box rgb(238, 242, 255) Service agents
      participant AGENT as Selected service agent
      participant LG as LangGraph orchestration
    end

    box rgb(245, 243, 255) PostgreSQL schemas / tables
      participant ONT as OntologyContext
      participant DOCKB as OpsEnergyDoc
      participant OPSDB as OpsWorkOrder
      participant MART as MartFacts
      participant REF as ReferenceSchemaTimeSeries
      participant OPSREPORT as OpsReportSchema
    end

    box rgb(236, 253, 245) Backend API outputs
      participant ANSWER as Chat response SSE
      participant STATUS as Job status response
      participant APPROVAL as Approval state
    end

    box rgb(240, 249, 255) Frontend UI
      participant FRONT as React dashboard UI
    end

    USER->>API: submit /api/chat question · backend E2E timer starts
    API->>ST1: Stage1 avg 0.02 ms
    alt query request
      ST1->>ST2: Stage2 avg 1,123.50 ms
      ST2->>AGENT: dispatch to selected agent · dispatch overhead included in LangGraph total
      AGENT->>ONT: DB/context lookup · separate edge benchmark ~165 ms when used
      AGENT->>DOCKB: document KB lookup · separate edge benchmark ~135 ms when used
      AGENT->>REF: reference time-series lookup · route별 평균 112.52–798.95 ms
      AGENT->>MART: mart lookup · separate edge benchmark ~136-157 ms when used
      AGENT->>OPSREPORT: report table lookup · separate edge benchmark ~879 ms when used
      AGENT-->>ANSWER: agent build · forecast 18,330.94 ms / report 6,385.24 ms
      ANSWER-->>API: /api/chat E2E avg 6,520.38 ms
      API-->>FRONT: browser fetch+parse+DOM avg 141.87 ms
    else action approval off_topic or multi_intent
      ST1->>GATE: gate node avg ~0.01 ms · gate E2E depends on routed answer
      GATE->>LG: create service job only when runtime action needs review
      LG->>OPSDB: read or prepare ops work order state
      LG->>ONT: attach meter domain context
      LG->>REF: attach supporting numeric facts
      LG-->>STATUS: expose job state and caveats
      LG-->>APPROVAL: wait for human approval when required
      STATUS-->>API: return status path and progress payload
      APPROVAL-->>API: return pending approval state
      API-->>FRONT: status/caveat DOM 16.83 ms
      API-->>FRONT: approval modal DOM 16.83 ms
    end

    Note over USER,API: selected model metrics update Route1, Route2, agent, backend, frontend render latency.
    Note over ONT,REF: Runtime grounding uses ops, mart, reference, ontology and ops.energy_doc sources.

%% hover USER: 실제 서비스 사용자가 입력한 runtime 질문입니다.
%% hover API: FastAPI /chat 또는 /chat/stream 진입점입니다. 평가 runner가 아니라 서비스 API입니다.
%% hover ST1: Stage1은 query, action_request, approval_required, off_topic, multi_intent 같은 요청 유형을 판단합니다.
%% hover ST2: Stage2는 query 요청만 anomaly, cms, report, forecast, domain_qa 업무 agent로 분기합니다.
%% hover GATE: query가 아닌 요청은 clarify, reject, approval wait 같은 runtime gate로 처리합니다.
%% hover AGENT: 선택된 서비스 agent입니다. anomaly/cms/report/forecast/domain_qa 중 하나이며 PostgreSQL schema/table/ontology 근거를 조회해 답변을 만듭니다.
%% hover LG: LangGraph orchestration입니다. runtime action 또는 승인 필요 작업의 상태 전이, dry-run guard, 승인 대기를 조정합니다.
%% hover ONT: ontology.meter_context, ontology.meter_measurement_context 기반 계량기·측정·도메인 맥락입니다.
%% hover DOCKB: ops.energy_doc 문서 KB입니다. 문서 chunk와 embedding 근거를 제공합니다.
%% hover OPSDB: ops.work_order 운영 작업지시 계층입니다.
%% hover MART: mart.anomaly_warning_1h, mart.anomaly_feature_1h, mart.peak_feature_15min, mart.pmax_forecast_15min 등 mart schema/table 계층입니다.
%% hover REFPG: reference.corrected_resampled_1h/15min reference schema의 정제 시계열입니다.
%% hover OPSREPORT: ops.monthly_report, ops.daily_report, ops.weekly_report, ops.report_archive 보고서 계층입니다.
%% hover ANSWER: backend가 생성하는 chat response 또는 SSE token stream입니다.
%% hover STATUS: backend가 반환하는 job status response입니다. status path, progress, result state를 포함합니다.
%% hover APPROVAL: backend가 관리하는 approval state입니다. pending, approved, rejected 상태를 포함합니다.
%% hover FRONT: backend API output을 소비해 chat bubble, status badge, approval modal, caveat notice로 렌더링하는 frontend UI입니다.
